OL,3,GNEWSAIan McKellen set to perform as a
OL,4,Ahologram in new play
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Ian McKellen is set to star in the
OL,7,FEuropean premier of a play in which he
OL,8,Fappears as a hologram.
OL,10,FThe 87-year-old Lord of the Rings star,
OL,11,Fwho was born in Burnley, will perform
OL,12,Fin An Ark when it comes to Manchester's
OL,13,FFactory International Aviva Studios.
OL,15,FThe play, which debuted in New York,
OL,16,Fwill feature McKellen and Bridgerton
OL,17,Fstar Golda Rosheuvel in 3D holographic
OL,18,Fform, which was achieved using 52
OL,19,Fcameras filming them from multiple
OL,20,Fangles.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
